<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">Thuituen</book>
  <para style="h">Thuituen</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thuituen</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thuituen</para>
  <para style="mt">Thuituen</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem manghai David capa kah thuituenkung ol.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A honghi, a honghi ni. Thuituenkung loh, “A honghi, a honghi, a honghi boeih ni,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khohmik hmuiah a thakthae bangla a thakthaenah cungkuem lamloh hlang taengah balae a rhoeikhangnah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thawnpuei loh cet tih cadil thoeng coeng dae diklai he kumhal duela a pai moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khomik loh thoeng tih khomik he kun bal. Te phoeiah amah hmuen te a hloem pahoi tiih thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuithim la cet tih tlangpuei la aka mael khohli he a tinghil, a tinghil doela cet. Te phoeiah khohli he a hlaep la mael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Soklong boeih khaw tuitunli la pawk. Tedae tuitunli tah hah tlaih pawh. Soklong rhoek khaw a long nah hmuen la mael tih cet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Olka boeih he bonghnaek. Hlang loh a thui hamla a noeng moenih. Mik loh a hmuh te hah pawt tih hna a yaak te cung pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mebang khaw aka om tangtae bangla om bal vetih, mebang khaw a saii tangtae bangla a saii bal ni. Te dongah kah khomik hmuikah he a thai boeih moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A thai he hmu lah, he tah khosuen lamloh om oepsoeh coeng tih mamih hlan lamloh om,’ a ti te ol om nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lamhma kah neh hmailong kah khaw poekkoepnah om pawh. Aka om ham te khaw hmailong kah aka om taengah poekkoepnah om mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai tah thuituenkung neh Jerusalem kah Israel soah manghai la ka om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaan hmui kah a saii boeih te cueihnah neh dawtlet ham khaw, yaam ham khaw ka lungbuei ka paek. Hlang capa rhoek te amah phaep uh saeh tila Pathen loh yoethae bibi a khueh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khomik hmui kah a saii bitat boeih te ka hmuh. Te dongah a cungkuem he a honghi neh khohli doinah ni ne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aka khun he dueng hamla coeng pawt tih vitvawtnah khaw tae hamla coeng pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kamah tah ka lungbuei ah ka cal tih, “Ka pantai tih Jerusalem ah khaw ka mikhmuh kah aka om boeih lakah cueihnah ka thap, ka lungbuei long khaw cueihnah neh mingnah muep a hmuh la he,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lungbuei he cueihnah ming ham neh anglatnah ming ham ka paek. Te dongah lunghmangnah he khaw khohli dongkah kohnek ni tila ka ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cueihnah a cungkuem nen khaw konoinah cungkuem tih, mingnah a koei khaw nganboh ni a. koei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kai tah ka lungbuei ah, “Cet laeh lamtah, nang te kohoenah neh kan noem eh. Te dongah hnothen te a hmuh dae te khaw a honghi he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nueihbu te ka yan tih kohoenah neh, 'Banim a saii he,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lungbuei khuikah tah ka saa he misurtui neh dangrhoek ham, ka lungbuei he cueihnah neh hmaithawn ham, a hingnah khohnin tarhing la vaan hmuikah a saii uh te, hlang ca rhoek ham mebang a then khaw ka hmuh hil, lunghmangnah te tuuk hamla ka yaam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka bibi ka rhoeng sak tih kamah ham im ka sak, kamah hamla misur ka phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kamah hamla dum neh khotu ka tawn tih a khuiah thing thaih boeih ka tue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Duup thing aka poe te tui suep hamla kamah loh tuibuem ka saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />salpa neh salnu khaw ka lai tih im kah cacah khaw ka taengah om. Saelhung saelrhoi neh boiva khaw kamah taengah muep om tih, ka mikhmuh ah Jerusalem kah aka om boeih lakah yet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kamah hamla cak neh sui khaw, manghai lungthen neh paeng ka calui coeng. Kamah ham aka hlai, aka hlai rhoek khaw, hlang capa kah omthenbawnnah la rhoiding khaw ka khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem ah ka rhoeng tih ka mikhmuh kah aka om boeih lakah ka lawn. Kai cueihnah khaw ka khuiah cak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mik loh a hoe boeih tah ka hloh moenih. Ka lungbuei te kohoenah cungkuem lamloh ka hloh moenih. Ka thakthaenah cungkuem khuiah pataeng ka lungbuei a kohoe. He ni ka thakthaenah cungkuem dongah kai kah khoyo la a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kut loh a saii bangla ka bibi boeih khaw, thakthaenah te khaw ka hoihaeng coeng. Te te saii hamla ka thakthae akhaw a honghi neh khohli doinah boeih ni he. Te dongah khomik hmuikah he rhoeikhangnah moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cueihnah hmuh hamla anglatnah neh lunghmangnah khaw ka mael thil. Oepsoeh la a saii pah phoeiah manghai hnukah aka pawk te mebang hlang nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vangnah he hmaisuep lakah rhoeikhangnah a om bangla cueihnah he lunghmangnah lakah rhoeikhangnah om tila ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlang cueih kah a mik tah a lu khuiah om dae aka ang tah hmaisuep ah pongpa. Te dongah amih boeih te a hmatoeng pakhat loh a mah tila ka ming van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungbuei khuiah tah, “Kai khaw aka ang kah hmatoeng bangla kamah m'mah. Te dongah metlam ka cueih tih ka hoeikhang?” ka ti. Te vaengah ka lungbuei nen tah, “He khaw a honghi coeng ni,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aka ang bangla aka cueih ham khaw kumhal duela poekkoepnah om mahpawh. Oepsoeh la khohnin aka pai boeih dongah a hnilh pawn ni. Aka cueih khaw aka ang bangla duek aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te dongah hingnah te ka hmuhuet coeng. Khomik hmuikah a saii bitat he kai ham tah thae coeng. A cungkuem he a honghi neh khohli doinah mai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thakthaenah boeih he ka hmuhuet coeng. Khomik hmuikah thakthaekung la ka om. Te te ka hnukah aka om hlang ham ni ka khueh eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ulong a ming huek? Lunghmang khaw hlangcueih om nim? Tedae ka thakthaenah boeih te a taemrhai hae ni. Te nen te ka thakthae tih te nen te ka cueih dae khomik hmuiah tah te khaw a honghi mai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te dongah ka lungbuei he talsae la ka mael puei. Khomik hmuiah thakthaenah cungkuem neh ka thakthae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlang bangla cueihnah neh, mingnah neh, thoemthainah neh thakthaenah la om. Tedae amah ham aka thakthae pawt hlang te khaw a khoyo a paek. He khaw a honghi neh thae tangkik mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thakthaenah cungkuem dong neh a lungbuei kah kohnek dongah khaw hlang hamla balae aka om? Anih te khomik hmuikah thakthaekung la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A khohnin te nganboh, a bibi khaw konoinah boeih ni. Khoyin ah pataeng a lungbuei ip pawh. He khaw amah la a honghi ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A caak tih a ok bangla hlang ham hnothen a om moenih. Tedae a hinglu a hmuh te ni a thakthaenah khui lamloh hnothen la a om. He khaw Pathen kut lamkah ni tila ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kai lamkah rhamvoel ah unim aka ca thai tih unim aka tawn bal?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah mikhmuh kah aka then hlang te tah cueihnah, mingnah neh kohoenah khaw a paek. Tedae aka tholh te tah Pathen mikhmuh kah aka then taengah paek hamla, coi hamla, calui hamla bibi a paek. He khaw a honghi neh khohli doinah mai ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A cungkuem dongah a tuetang om tih vaan hmuikah kongaih boeih dongah khaw a tue om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun ham tue neh duek ham tue khaw om. Aka phung hamla phung ham tue neh haih ham tue om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngawn ham tue neh hoeih sak ham tue khaw om. Phae ham tue neh sak ham tue khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rhah tue neh luem tue khaw om. Rhaengsae tue neh soipet tue khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungto voeih tue neh lungto calui tue khaw om. Kop tue neh a kop lamloh lakhla tue khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlap tue neh paltham tue khaw om. Ngaithuen tue neh voeih tue khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Phen tue neh bo tue khaw om. Duem om ham tue neh thui tue khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungnah tue neh thiinah tue om. Caemtloek tue neh rhoepnah tue om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih thakthaekung lamloh mebang rhoeikhangnah lae a saii?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih te phaep hamla Pathen loh hlang ca rhoek soah a paek te khaw bibi la ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A cungkuem he amah tue neh sakthen la a saii tih kumhal kah te khaw amih lungbuei ah a khueh pah. Te pawt cakhaw, a tong lamloh a bawt hil Pathen loh a saii bibi te hlang loh a hmuh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah hingnah dongah kohoe ham neh a then saii ham lakah amih ham a then a om moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hlang boeih he khaw ca mai saeh lamtah o mai saeh, hnothen khaw hmu mai saeh. Te te amah kah thakthaenah cungkuem khuiah Pathen kah kutdoe ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathen loh a cungkuem a saii tila ka ming. Amah tah kumhal duela om. Amah soah thap ham om pawt tih anih lamkah te yueh ham khaw a om bal moenih. Te dongah a mikhmuh ah a rhih uh ham ni Pathen loh a saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aka om oepsoeh te khaw, aka om ham te khaw om oepsoeh coeng. Te dongah a hloem tangtae te Pathen loh a toem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laitloeknah hmuen ah halangnah hnap om tih, duengnah hmuen ah halangnah hnap a om te khomik hmuiah koep ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lungbuei ah tah, “A kongaih boeih ham neh a bibi boeih ham khaw a tue a om coeng dongah, aka dueng neh halang khaw Pathen loh lai a tloek ni,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hlang ca rhoek kah dumlai dongah khaw ka lungbuei ah, “Amih te Pathen loh coelh saeh lamtah, amih bang he rhamsa ni amamih loh hmu saeh,” ka ti mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlang ca rhoek kah a hmatoeng neh rhamsa kah hmatoeng khaw hmatoeng pakhat ni. Amih ham he kah dueknah bangla ke dueknah khaw om tih a cungkuem ham hil pakhat la om. Te dongah rhamsa lakah hlang kah kumkonah a om moenih. A cungkuem he a honghi ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A cungkuem he hmuen pakhat la cet. A cungkuem helaipi lamloh ha thoeng. A cungkuem he laipi la mael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlang ca rhoek kah mueihla tah a so la cet tih rhamsa mueihla tah diklai khuila a suntlak thuk khaw ulong a ming?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te dongah a hamsum bangla a bibi dongah hlang a kohoe lakah ah a then om pawh tila ka hmuh. A hnukah aka thoeng ham te hmuh sak hamla ulong anih a khuen thai?
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mael tih khomik hmuikah a hnaemtaek rhoek boeih te ka sawt. Te te khomik hmuiah a saii uh tih a hnaemtaek rhoek kah mikphi aih ke, amih aka hloep ham khaw om pawh. Aka hnaemtaek rhoek kah kut ah tah a thadueng om tih a haemtaek rhoek te aka hloep om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kai tah aka hing pueng amih hlang hing rhoek lakah aka duek tangtae hlang duek rhoek te ka domyok sak mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te rhoi lakah khaw, aka om hlan neh khomik hmuikah khoboe thae a saii aka hmuh pawt te then duen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thakthaenah cungkuem neh bibi thoemthainah cungkuem khaw ka hmuh coeng. Te dongah hlang loh a hui taengkah thatlainah he khaw a honghi neh khohli doinah mai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aka ang loh a kut te a poem tih amah saa te a caak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thakthaenah neh khohli doinah kutnarhum a bae lakah kutvang dongkah aka bae mongnah he then ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mael vaengah he khomik hmuiah a honghi ni ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlang he pakhat bueng om tih a pabae a om moenih. Capa neh manuca khaw a taengah a om moenih. Te dongah a thakthaenah cungkuem dongah a bawtnah om pawh. A mik, a mik ah khuehtawn khaw hah pawh. U ham nim thakthaenah ka om tih, hnothen lamloh ka hinglu he a vaitah? He khaw a honghi neh boethae bibi coeng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pakhat lakah panit he then, amih ham tah a thakthaenah dongah khaw thapang then om coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cungku rhoi cakhaw pakhat loh a hui te a thoh. Tedae amah pakhat bueng ki aka cungku te khomap coeng tih anih aka thoh ham koep om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Panit a yalh rhoi vaengah tah amah rhoi khaw bae dae pakhat tah metlam a bae eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anih te khat khat loh khulae mai cakhaw a taengah ah panit la pai rhoi thai. Rhuihet pathum a yaep tah a yoei la a pat moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khodaeng dae aka cueih camoe he patong tih aka ang manghai lakah then. Anih te koep thuituen ham khaw a ming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pin nah im lamloh manghai taengla aka pawk khaw, a ram ah khodaeng la a cun khaw amah boeiloeih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khomik hmuiah aka pongpa mulhing boeih tah manghai yueng la aka pai camoe pabae taengah a pai te ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pilnam boeih ham te a bawtnah om pawh. Amah te cungkuem taengah a hmai la a om pah dae lamhnuk rhoek loh anih taengah ko a hoe uh moenih. He khaw a honghi neh khohli dongkah kohnek mai ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathen im la na caeh vaengkah bangla na kho neh na khokan te ngaithuen. Te dongah hnatun hamla n'tawn uh he aka ang kah hmueih nawn lakah then. Amih loh boethae a saii te khaw ming uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathen mikhmuh ah ol aka thak la na ka te let sak boel lamtah na lungbuei loe boel saeh. Pathen tah vaan ah om tih nang tah diklai ah ni na om. Te dongah na ol yol saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bibi a cungkuem vaengah mueimang khaw om tih olka a cungkuem vaengah hlang ang ol la poeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathen taengah olcaeng na caeng vaengah na thuung ham uelh boeh. Na caeng bangla a thuung te aka ang kah kongaih moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na caeng tih na thuung pawt lakah na caeng pawt te then.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na pumsa te tholh sak hamla na ka te khueh boeh. Tohtamaeh kah te puencawn mikhmuh ah thui boeh. Na ol dongah balae tih Pathen thin a toek? Te dongah na kut dongkah bibi te a phae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mueimang a yet vaengah a honghi neh ol khaw yet. Te dongah Pathen te rhih laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paeng ah khodaeng hnaemtaeknah khaw, tiktamnah neh duengnah lamloh pitnah na hmuh. Te te ngaihnah dongah khaw na ngaihmang sak boeh. A sang soah a sang la a dawn tih amih lakah sang lah ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah khohmuen aka tawn manghai loh a cungkuem dongah khohmuen kah rhoeikhangnah te amah la a dang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangka aka lungnah khaw tangka hah pawt tih boeinah aka lungnah te khaw a vueithaih a dang moenih. He khaw a honghi mai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnothen a ping ham vaengah te te aka ca rhoek khaw pungtai uh. Te dongah a kungmah te tah a mik loh danyoe sawthong phoeiah tah balae a thoemthainah voel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aka thotat tah a yol akhaw, a yet a caak akhaw a ih tui. Tedae hlanglen kah khobuh long tah amah te ih sak ham pataeng duem sak pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Boethae a om he khomik hmuiah a tloh la ka hmuh. Khuehtawn he a kungmah loh a ngaithuen akhaw amah yoethaenah ham ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuehtawn he bibi thae ah a paltham mai. Te dongah capa a sak akhaw a kut dongah pakhat pataeng a om moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A manu bung lamloh pumtling ha thoeng tih a caeh vaengah khaw a thoeng vaengkah banglam ni a. mael. A thakthaenah lamkah te pakhat pataeng a kut dongah a khuen hamla a phueih moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ha thoeng vaengkah bangla voeivang a caeh he khaw boeih thae tih tlo bal. Te dongah khohli hamla a thakthae he anih ham balae a rhoeikhangnah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amah tue khuiah khaw hmaisuep ah a caak tih a tlohtat neh a thinhul ah muep hue a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sakthen la caak ham neh ok ham khaw, hnothen a hmuh ham khaw a then la ka hmuh coeng ne. Khomik hmui kah a hingnah khohnin tarhing la a thakthaenah cungkuem neh thakthae. A hingnah te Pathen loh anih taengah amah kah hamsum la a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathen loh hlang boeih te a taengkah khuehtawn neh koeva a paek pai. Te dongah te lamloh a caak ham neh a hamsum a duen ham khaw, a thakthaenah khui lamloh kohoe sak ham khaw a taemrhai. He tah Pathen kah kutdoe rhoe ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khomik hmuiah ka hmuh he boethae la om tih te te hlang soah yet coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathen loh hlang te a taengah khuehtawn, koeva, neh thangpomnah a paek. Te dongah a ngaidam boeih khui lamloh a hinglu te talh pawh. Tedae te te a caak hamla Pathen loh anih a taemrhai sak moenih. Te te kholong hlang a cah he a honghi neh tloh thae ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hlang long he yakhat a sak tih kum a yet a hing mai khaming, a kum khohnin khaw muep lo mai khaming. Tedae a hinglu loh hnothen te cung pawt tih phuel ah khaw amah taengah a om pah moenih. Anih lakah aka rhumpu te then lah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anih te a honghi la ha thoeng tih a hmuep ah a caeh dongah a ming khaw a hmuep ah a vuei pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khomik hmu pawt mai cakhaw mongnah he tah a tloe loh anih lakah a ming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum thawngkhat a rhaep la hing sitoe cakhaw hnothen a hmuh hae moenih. Hmuen pakhat la boeih a caeh moenih a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlang kah thakthaenah boeih he a ka ham ni. Tedae a hinglu khaw a cung tlaih moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aka ang lakah aka cueih taengah balae a hoeikhang? Mulhing taengah aka pongpa mangdaeng te balae a ming?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinglu a van lakah tah mik kah a hmuethma he then. He khaw a honghi neh khohli doinah mai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mebang khaw aka om coeng te tah a ming oepsoeh la a sui dongah hlang he amah ah ming uh coeng. Tedae amah lakah thaom neh aka khulae taengah tah laitloek ham a noeng moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ol muep a lo vaengah a honghi khaw ping tih hlang hamla balae a hoeikhang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hingnah khohnin tarhing kah hingnah dongah a honghi neh khokhawn bangla a khum te hlang hamla metla a then khaw unim aka ming? Khomik hmuiah anih hnukla aka om te hlang taengah ulong a thui thai?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A ming te tah situi then lakah ah then tih dueknah hnin he a cun khohnin lakah then.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nguekcoinah im la caeh te buhkoknah im la caeh lakah then. He tah hlang boeih kah a bawtnah coeng tih aka hing loh a lungbuei ah dueh saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Konoinah he nueihbu lakah then. Maelhmai thaenah long ni lungbuei a voelphoeng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aka cueih kah lungbuei tah nguekcoinah im ah dae aka ang kah lungbuei tah kohoenah im ah om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aka cueih kah tluungnah hnatun he tah aka ang laa aka hnatun hlang lakah then.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Am lae kah hling ol bangla aka ang kah nueihbu khaw om. Te dongah he khaw a honghi ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnaemtaeknah loh hlangcueih a yan sak tih kutdoe loh lungbuei a poo sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ol bawtnah he a tongnah lakah then. Aka ueh kah mueihla he aka oek kah mueihla lakah then.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huesak hamla na mueihla neh let sak boeh. Konoinah he aka ang kah rhang dongah ni a. kol.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Balae tih hnukbuet kah a tue aka om te tahae kah lakah a then la a om?” ti boeh. Te bang te cueihnah neh na dawt moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cueihnah tah rho la then tih khomik aka hmu ham khaw hoeikhang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cueihnah hlipkhup ah om he tangka hlipkhup kah om banghui ni. Tedae mingnah he tah rhoeikhangnah la om tih cueihnah long tah a kungmah te a hing sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathen kah bibi te hmu lah. Amah loh a khun sak te dueng hamla aka noeng te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A then tue vaengah tah a then la om. Tedae a yoethae tue vaengkah khaw hmu. He khaw dumlai dongah Pathen loh voeivang ah a khueh. Te daengah ni hlang loh a hnukah te pakhat khaw ahmu pawt eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamah kah a honghi tue vaengah a cungkuem te ka hmuh. Amah kah duengnah dongah aka paltham hlang dueng om tih a boethae neh aka nguel halang khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aka dueng koek la om boel lamtah hoeikhangnah aih ham khaw cueih boeh. Balae tih namah na phae uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Muep poehlip boel lamtah lunghmang la om boeh. Balae tih namah tue pawt vaengah na duek eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He he na tuuk vaengah na kut te ke lamloh na hlah pawt ham then. Pathen aka rhih ham tah a cungkuem te a noeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cueihnah long tah aka cueih te khopuei kah aka om boei parha lakah khaw a tanglue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Diklai hman ah hnothen a saii tih aka tholh pawh hlang dueng a om moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ol a thui uh boeih te khaw na lungbuei pae boeh. Te pawt koinih na sal loh namah n'tap te na ya ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Namah loh hlang tloe na tap te na lungbuei loh a voei a yet khaw a ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />He boeih he cueihnah neh ka noemcai tih, “Ka cueih eh?,” ka ti dae kai lamloh lakhla laklo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te tla a om te khaw hla coeng tih a dung lakah dung coeng. Te te aka hmu te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kamah neh ka lungbuei khaw, uepnah koikah halangnah neh anglatnah, lunghmangnah te ming ham neh yaam hamla, cueihnah neh poeknah tlap hamla ka maelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lungbuei te tluum neh soh la a tung tih a kut dongah pinyennah aka khueh huta he dueknah lakah khahing la ka hmuh. Pathen mikhmuh ah aka then tah anih aeng lamloh loeih suidae aka tholh tah anih loh a tuuk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />So lah he, thuituenkung loh a thui bangla poeknah hmuh hamla pakhat soah pakhat ka phoel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Te te ka hinglu loh a tlap pueng dae ka hmuh moenih. Thawngkhat khuiah tongpa pakhat ka hmuh dae te boeih lakli ah huta ka hmuh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />He bueng mah so lah. Pathen loh hlang he a thuem la a saii coeng dae amih loh phuengnah muep a tlap uh te ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unim hlang cueih bangla aka om? Olka te thuingaihnah aka ming te unim? Hlang he cueihnah loh a maelhmai a sae sak tih a maelhmai khaw sarhi a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kamah manghai ka dongkah he Pathen olhlo dongkah dumlai la a om dongah ngaithuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mikhmuh lamloh na caeh vaengah let boeh. Boethae ol dongah pai boeh. A cungkuem te a ngaih bangla a saii bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Manghai ol dongah a khuet om tih anih te ulong, “Balae na saii?” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Olpaek aka tuem tah boethae ol a ming moenih. Aka cueih kah lungbuei tah a tue neh laitloeknah khaw a ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hlang kah boethae he amah soah ping cakhaw ngaihnah cungkuem ham he a tuetang neh a khosing om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anih te metla a om te khaw a ming moenih. Te vanbangla mebang a om ham khaw te anih taengah ulong a thui thai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khohli te hloh hamla khohli soah hlang a boei moenih. Dueknah khohnin soah a khuet aka khueh khaw om pawh. Caemtloeknah khuiah khaw paanah a om moenih. Te dongah halangnah loh a boei te loeih sak mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A cungkuem he ka sawt tih khomik hmuikah a saii bibi boeih he ka lungbuei ah ka dueh. Hlang loh hlang soah amah kah a yoethae ham duela a taemrhai tue khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Halang rhoek a up uh he ka sawt vaengah hmuen cim lamloh aka thoeng tih aka pongpa rhoek ni. Tedae te bang a saii nah khopuei ah a hnilh uh coeng. He khaw a honghi coeng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khoboe thae khaw oltloeknah hat a saii hae moenih. Te dongah ni hlang koca kah lungbuei tah a khuiah thae saii hamla a hah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aka tholh khaw boethae yakhat a saii tih anih te nguel mai cakhaw Pathen aka rhih tih a mikhmuh ah aka rhih taengah ni hnothen a om eh tila ka ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tedae hnothen he halang taengah om mahpawh. Anih te Pathen mikhmuh ah a rhih pawt dongah khokhawn bangla a khohnin vang mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Diklai ah aka thoeng he a honghi mai ni. Aka dueng khaw a soah halang kah khoboe bangla aka thoeng te om tih, halang khaw a taengah aka dueng kah khoboe bangla a thoeng pah te om bal. He khaw a honghi mai la ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te dongah kai tah kohoenah he ni ka domyok sak mai. Khomik hmuiah a caak, a ok tih ko a hoe mak atah hlang ham hnothen a om moenih. Te dongah anih te a hingnah tue vaengah tah a thakthaenah nen khaw a naem coeng. Te te Pathen loh anih taengla khomik hmuiah a paek coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cueihnah ming ham neh bibi hmuh ham ka lungbuei te ka paek coeng. Te long te diklai hman ah tah khothaih ah khaw, khoyin ah khaw, a mik te ih sak pawt tih hmuh sak pawt ham a saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathen bibi boeih te ka hmuh. Te bibi te hlang loh a hmuh ham a noeng moenih. Khomik hmuiah a saii te hlang loh tlap hamla thakthae sitoe mai cakhaw a hmuh moenih. Aka cueih loh ming hamla a ti van akhaw a hmuh hamla a noeng moenih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A cungkuem he ka lungbuei ah ka dueh tih a cungkuem he ka boelh. Aka dueng neh aka cueih khaw, a bibi khaw Pathen kut dongah ni a om. Lungnah khaw, hmuhuetnah khaw hlang loh amih hmai kah he boeih a ming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A cungkuem he a cungkuem taengah a om vanbangla, aka dueng ham neh halang ham khaw, aka then ham neh aka caih ham khaw, rhalawt ham khaw, aka nawn ham neh aka nawn pawt ham khaw, aka then bangla aka tholh ham khaw, olhlo bangla toemngam aka rhih ham khaw hmatoeng pakhat ni a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khomik hmuikah aka thoeng he cungkuem dongah thae coeng. A cungkuem ham he hmatoeng pakhat la om. Hlang koca rhoek kah lungbuei khaw boethae hah tih amamih a hing vaengah amih thinko ah anglatnah om. Te phoeiah a hnuk la duek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tedae u khaw hingnah cungkuem taengah kaibaeng tih aka sun uh te tah pangtungnah om. Ui pataeng khaw amah a hing vaengah tah sathueng aka duek lakah then.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aka hing rhoek long tah a duek uh ham te a ming dae a duek long tah pakhat khaw a ming uh moenih. Amih ham thapang khaw ming voel pawt tih amih poekkoepnah khaw a hnilh uh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amih kah lungnah neh amih kah hmuhuetnah khaw, amih kah thatlainah khaw paltham oepsoeh coeng. Khomik hmuiah a thoeng vanbangla a cungkuem dongah amih kah hamsum tah kumhal duela om voel pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cet laeh, na buh te kohoenah neh ca lamtah na misurtui khaw lungbuei then neh o laeh. Pathen loh na bibi te a doe oepsoeh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tue takuem ah na himbai te a bok la om saeh lamtah na lu dongkah situi te khaw vawt boel saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khohnin yungah na lungnah yuu neh hingnah hmuh lah. Khomik hmuiah nang taengah m'paek na hingnah te a honghi ni. Hingnah dongkah na hamsum he khaw khohnin yungah nang ham tah a honghi ni. Te dongah na thakthaenah nen ni nang te khomik hmui ah thakthaekung la na om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na kut loh saii hamla a hmuh boeih te tah na thadueng neh saii. Na pha ham koi saelkhui ah tah bibi neh poeknah khaw, mingnah neh cueihnah khaw a om moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mael tih khomik hmuiah he loehlangnah khaw kapyang ham pawt tih caemtloek khaw hlangrhalh rhoek ham moenih, buh khaw aka cueih rhoek bueng ham pawt tih khuehtawn khaw aka yakming rhoek bueng ham moenih, mikdaithen khaw aka ming rhoek bueng ham bal moenih, te boeih te amah tue neh a yoekam bangla thoeng tila ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te dongah hlang loh amah tue te a ming van moenih. Boethae kah ngoi dongah aka man nga neh pael loh a tuuk vaa banglam ni a om. Amih hlang koca rhoek tah boethae tue loh a hlaeh tih amih te buengrhuet a tlak thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khomik hmuikah cueihnah he ka hmuh vaengah kai ham tah te te len coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khopuei he yit tih a khuikah hlang te a yol vaengah tah manghai puei a paan tih a vael phoeiah tluum len a sak thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te vaengah a khuikah khodaeng te hlang cueih la phoe tih a cueihnah neh khopuei te a loeih sak. Tedae hlang loh khodaeng te tah hlang la poek pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te dongah, “Cueihnah he thayung thamal lakah then,” ka ti dae khodaeng kah cueihnah tah a hnaep pah tih a ol te khaw hnatun uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hlangcueih ol tah aka ang rhoek aka taemrhai kah a pang lakah mongnah neh a hnatun uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cueihnah he caemrhal kah hnopai lakah then dae pakhat kah tholh loh a then muep a phae.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dueknah pilyang loh thungnom situi thaa te a rhim sak bangla vel lunghmangnah vik te cueihnah lakah khaw, thangpomnah lakah khaw nul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aka cueih kah lungbuei tah a bantang la mael tih aka ang kah lungbuei tah a banvoei la mael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Longpuei ah pataeng lunghmang tah lunghmang bangla a lungbuei a talh hil pongpa tih a lunghmang te a cungkuem taengah a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aka taemrhai kah mueihla loh nang taengah pai mai cakhaw na hmuen phawt boeh. Hoeihnah long ni tholhnah a len khaw a duem sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Boei mikhmuh lamloh tohtamaeh la aka thoeng ka hmuh te khomik hmuiah a thae la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pavai te hmuensang la muep a khueh vaengah hlanglen tah mathoe la kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Marhang dongkah sal rhoek ka hmuh vaengah mangpa rhoek tah diklai ah sal bangla pongpa uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rhom aka too khaw a khuila cungku tih vongtung aka phae khaw rhul loh amah a tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungto aka puen khaw amah ah a kothae tih thing aka phaek khaw te nen te tohngah saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thi te duu tih a ha te a haat pawt atah thadueng khaw vak. Tedae rhoeikhangnah tah cueihnah long ni a khui sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Calthai a om pawt ah rhul loh a tuk atah cal kung ham rhoeikhangnah moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hlang cueih ka dongkah ol tah mikdaithen om tih aka ang kah hmuilai long tah amah a dolh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ka dongkah ol tongnah te lunghmangnah la om tih a ka dongkah ol bawtnah khaw boethae angvawknah la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lunghmang tah ol pung tih metla a om khaw hlang loh ming pawh. A hnuk ah metla a om ham khaw a taengah ulong a thui pah voel?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hlang ang kah thakthaenah loh amah a kohnue sak tih khopuei la caeh ham khaw ming pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na manghai khaw camoe tih na mangpa rhoek loh mincang ah nah a caak uh te, khohmuen nang ngawn tah khomap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na manghai te hlangcoelh capa van tih, na mangpa rhoek long khaw rhuihahnah ham pawt tih thayung thamal hamla a tue vaengah aka ca khohmuen nang tah na yoethen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngaknah lamloh tul pae hmawn tih kut poemnah lamloh im cae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nueihbu ham buh a khueh tih misurtui loh hingnah ko a hoe sak. Tedae tangka loh a cungkuem te a doo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na cangnah nen khaw manghai te tap boeh. Imkhui kah na thingkong dongah khaw hlanglen te tap boeh. Vaan kah vaa loh ol te khuen vetih ol te a phae loh a kungmah taengah thui ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na buh te tui hman ah tueih lamtah a khohnin a cungkuem phoeiah na hmuh bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Parhih taeng neh parhet taengah khaw hamsum te pae lamtah khohmuen ah mebang yoethae a pai ham khaw na ming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khomai a thah atah diklai ah khonal nam tih thing te tuithim lam khaw, tlangpuei lam khaw cungku. Thing a cungku nah hmuen ah pahoi yalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khohli aka dawn loh soem pawt vetih khomai dongkah aka so loh at mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khohli kah longpuei neh bungko khuikah rhuh a bae te khaw na ming pawt bangla, cungkuem aka saii Pathen kah bibi te na ming van moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na cangti te mincang ah tuh lamtah hlaem ah khaw na kut te duem sak boeh. Heben hebang ah metla a khui he khaw na ming moenih. Te rhoi te vanat la then ngawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vangnah he didip pai tih khomik a hmuh te mik hamla then.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlang he kum a yet a hing van atah a cungkuem dongah a kohoe saeh. Tedae hmaisuep kah khohnin te poek saeh. Aka thoeng ham boeih he a honghi la muep om pueng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na tongpang oila vaengah na kohoe sak lamtah na cacawn tue vaengah na lungbuei na voelphoeng sak mako. Na lungbuei kah khosing neh na mik kah hmuhnah dongah pongpa ngawn. Tedae te boeih ham te Pathen loh laitloeknah khuila nang n'khuen ni tila ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te dongah konoinah te na lungbuei lamloh khoe lamtah boethae khaw na pum lamloh pit laeh. Oila neh cavaa khaw a honghi mai ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Yoethae khohnin a pai hlan kah na cacawn tue vaengah nang aka suen te poek. Kum loh a pha vaengah tah a khuiah kai hamla kongaih om pawh na ti ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khomik neh vangnah, hla neh aisi loh hmuep tih khonal hnukkah khomai a mael hlan vaengah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te khohnin ah tah im tawt rhoek te tonga uh vetih tatthai hlang rhoek khaw khun uh ni. Sum kuelh rhoek khaw muei vetih paa ni. Bangbuet longah aka so khaw a hmuep pah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thohkhaih te imdak ah a khaih uh vetih sumkuelh ol khaw dim ni. Vaa ol dongah thoo vetih laa sa nu rhoek khaw boeih ngam uh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sang neh longpuei ah mueirhih te a rhih uh bal ni. Noe thing khaw khooi vetih tangku khaw canawt ni. Huengaihnah khaw talh tih hlang loh amah kah kumhal im la cet tih aka rhaengsae rhoek loh imdak ah a vael uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cak rhui siing a pat pawt ah khaw sui tuidueh paep tih tuisih kah amrhaeng rhek. Tuito kah hmuikil khaw po coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te vaengah laipi tah a om hmuen bangla diklai la mael tih mueihla tah aka pae kung Pathen taengla mael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A honghi kah a honghi ni, thuituenkung loh a honghi ni boeih a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aka cueih thuituenkung la a om bangla hoeikhangnah phoeiah khaw pilnam te mingnah neh a tukkil bal tih a khiingmong. Te vaengah thuidoeknah khaw a dueng la muep a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuituenkung loh kongaih ol te hmuh hamla a tlap tih oltak ol te a dueng la a daek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hlang cueih ol tah ciksum bangla, olboep boei aka khing thikhing bangla om. Te te tu dawn pakhat loh a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te phoeikah a koeinah la, ka ca te n'thuituen pai saeh. Cabu saii ham he rhu tih bawt pawh. Muep cangnah khaw pumsa kah tawnbanah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ol bawtnah la a cungkuem aka ya loh Pathen te rhih lamtah a olpaek te tuem. He he hlang boeih ham ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bibi boeih neh a thuh boeih te khaw, a thae khaw, a then a khaw Pathen loh laitloeknah khuila a khuen ni.
  </para>
</usx>
